"Later, Khachi joins Nathan, Aarl, Sarah and Stella as the Heirs."
"Later, he is christened [Shield of Hope]; his divine light is the bane of the undead."
"Years later, Sarya teaches him theology, and he no longer sleeps but meditates, glowing."
"He learns sainthood by consuming the territory of Deiman."
"He kills Sussu in her vault with a hammer blow and heals lethal wounds by decree."
"He resurrects Stella after Badud beheads her."
"He takes the class Light of Judgement and gains a halo."
"In the Blight his divinity doubles and his fur lightens toward blonde."
"At the Crater he absorbs part of Deiman's remnant; his Talent becomes Godhead."
"His tenets are Humility, Virtue and Resolve; he calls himself Heir of Deiman."
"In the Ostren war he blesses the Accord's host, kills Amoh by word, and resurrects Vira."
"At the Conclave he kills Deiman's Last Champion and Bandrin, and revives Aarl mid-duel."
"Nine years later he lectures on virtue at Gemore's Archive to many students."
